{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "FWHDHVBMPDQNSAS7LMIGV5MLV77PRP5C",
    "type": "home",
    "storyId": "00000021062001",
    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "おマチさん！　アナタ……呪われていますっ！",
            "enText": "Machi! I'm afraid you are… cursed!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -3603844417410194398,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "えぇー！！",
            "enText": "Whaaat?!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -4817498941432622916,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "私、そんな普通じゃない状態だったんですか！\r\nやだやだ、なんの呪いですか～！？",
            "enText": "And here I thought I just had average luck!\nNo way! What kind of curse is it?!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -2651654971763458669,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "はい、シラオキ様のお告げによりますと……\r\nずばり！『【よりによって今】の呪い』です！",
            "enText": "According to the great Shiraoki, it is\nthe curse of \"unfortunate timing\"!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 831262004153628833,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "『【よりによって今】の呪い』……！？\r\nそれっていったい……！？\nなんか名前の通りな気もしますが……！",
            "enText": "\"Unfortunate timing\"? What does that mean?!\nI'm literally cursed with bad timing?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -6833582064698665509,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "名前の通りですっ！！",
            "enText": "Yes, literally!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 2968090668903712659,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "あ、やっぱり……でもたしかに、\r\n『今はやめて～！』って思ったこと、\nよく起きてるかもです。",
            "enText": "I knew it… I've had lots of moments where\nI felt like \"Why today of all days?\"",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -2290281614571935191,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "フクちゃん先輩、なんとかならないですか～！\r\n呪いを解いてください……！",
            "enText": "Fuku! Isn't there anything you can do?\nPlease break the curse on me!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 3487509179915429047,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "ふっふっふ、お任せくださいな！\r\nなぜこの話を切り出したとお思いですか。",
            "enText": "Heh heh heh. There certainly is!\nWhy do you think I brought up the subject?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 5279706368933601644,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "なにを隠そう、シラオキ様秘伝の聖水が\r\nご用意できたからで――",
            "enText": "It is because I come bearing the\ngreat Shiraoki's holy water ——",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -2162904620118053726,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "…………あれ、忘れてる！？",
            "enText": "…Huh? I forgot it!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -626440750497733857,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "よりによって今っ！？",
            "enText": "Why today of all days?!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -7943392976500491789,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780175834,
    "humanTl": true
}